Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 20:39:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 64/65] upstream #704: fix: survive the PulseAudio server going
 away in the audio playing detector

Carried from https://github.com/Almamu/linux-wallpaperengine/pull/704 (by ziggityzack) until it is merged upstream.

Both commits of the pull request (5c647602), squashed. It contains
#655's NULL guards, which the series already carries, so the detector
files are taken from the pull request whole. Fixes upstream #649: with
no PulseAudio server answering, the detector's constructor waited for
PA_CONTEXT_READY forever and the engine never drew.
